              +
              ] significantly overestimated that of WBW sweat (59 ± 27 vs. 41 ± 19 meq/l, P = 0.000 and 4.4 ± 0.7 vs. 3.6 ± 0.7 meq/l, P = 0.000, respectively). For both sexes, the best sites for predicting WBW sweat [Na
